{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2843657b40df07a8","name":"Used Starships","source":{"id":"source:reference-2843657b40df07a8","title":"Used Starships","revision":25029,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T20:33:33Z","sha256":"ed1cdf8cf1ae789a64b77418e4ab608fbe89cc5aa0319edabcd68ba818874f12","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25029","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Used%20Starships&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2843657b40df07a8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Owning and operating a Used Starship can be a risky business. Though Used Starships are cheaper and easier to get hold of, they often develop their own unique quirks that prevent them from operating at full capacity. Whenever a Used Starship moves -3 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," (to the point where the vessel is taking a -5 penalty on attack rolls, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Checks"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},") or lower, the Used ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition"}," becomes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Until the ship receives repairs (using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," skill), it cannot move up the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by means of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reroute Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reroute_Power","referenceId":"reference:ae948ebe3acd7ddc"}," Action (although other means, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigging"},", can still be used).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
